[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429514\">7005M28</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the mechanism (2a) releasing it from the retainers/centering\ndevices (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045155.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the mechanism is\nnot damaged.</p><p>Positin the mechanism and attach it to\nthe retainers/centering devices.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429514\">7005M28</a></p>"]]